      "stop_timestamp": "2026-05-04T09:14:22.400000Z",
      "flags": null,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Three problems, shortest first.\n\n1. **Thirds.** The scaler multiplies then formats. It should choose the measure first and only then pick a number that measure can express.\n2. **Eggs.** A count is not a quantity. Whole-unit ingredients need rounding with a note, not a fraction.\n3. **Tin size.** This one is not rounding at all. A tin has an area, the recipe has a depth, and neither scales with the ingredient list.",
      "citations": []
     }
    ],
